# Important things to ignore
**/dist
**/node_modules

# Everything below is stuff that might show up but not certainly
/tmp
/out-tsc
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
/.pnp
.pnp.js
.vscode/*
/.idea
.env

# Mac stuff
## General
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

## Thumbnails
._*

## Files that might appear in the root of a volume
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.fseventsd
.Spotlight-V100
.TemporaryItems
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent

## Slop stuff
.claude
